{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>A Strange World Hidden Beneath the Abyss</strong> \ud83c\udf0c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since ancient times, a catastrophic event has torn the world apart, leaving behind an endless abyss - where the laws of nature are twisted, where forgotten civilizations lie buried, and where only the bravest dare to descend. The Abyss is not just a land... it is a mystery yet to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to step into the depths?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>An adventure unlike anything you've ever experienced</strong> <br>Explore <strong>10 unique worlds</strong> connected by the Abyss - ranging from prehistoric jungles and the kingdom of golems to cursed plains. Each layer holds a puzzle, a challenge, and a story waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight, survive, and grow</strong> <br>Face creatures never recorded in history, from wandering phantoms to ancient beasts guarding the Abyss's secrets. Craft, upgrade your gear, build your base... Will you fight head-on, or will you find hidden paths few dare to tread?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Build, tame, and master the Abyss</strong> <br>Use whatever you can find to develop a farm, extract rare resources, and even tame powerful creatures to fight alongside you. But remember, the Abyss is no easy place to survive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Co-op with friends or brave the journey alone</strong> <br>Your path can be solitary or shared with others. Will you become an explorer, a treasure hunter, or a seeker of truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26e9\ufe0f <strong>The gate has opened - do you have the courage to step in?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyss: New Dawn - The journey into the depths has only just begun\u2026</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Note to Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Quick Heads-up about the Trailer Content:</strong><br>Some of the high-end features shown in the trailer \u2014 such as advanced weapons, outfits, and rare pets - are real and fully functional. <br>However, they are tied to deeper layers within the 10 core worlds of the game. As of this Early Access version, only the <strong>first two zones</strong> are available:<br>\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Eldergrove</strong> \u2013 the starting realm<br>\u26ab <strong>Primorath</strong> \u2013 the first layer of the Abyss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher-tier resources and crafting materials showcased in the trailer will be introduced in <strong>future updates</strong>, as we continue building out the remaining nine layers.<br>So yes, all the good stuff is coming - it\u2019ll just take a little adventuring (and patience)!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/faa9c106640c4244deb1d0398df13930547878fe.jpg"},{"name":"From Nothing to Something","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/0595758d2ca4600161875a9ebf1bbfce3c944e89.jpg"},{"name":"Arm Yourself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/71fb453b6ad61e38bff0e7400928913c65e522db.jpg"},{"name":"Embers of a New Dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/be9cf731260f0ad502b009ec72ddb6cebfde8854.jpg"},{"name":"Through the First Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/169786982ea869268702b04c31cdd5019602ef1a.jpg"},{"name":"First Spark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/6f76ba78ac50964cc15634f0e24ec251662763ea.jpg"},{"name":"The Forgotten Verse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/d5