trong> are available:<br>\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Eldergrove</strong> \u2013 the starting realm<br>\u26ab <strong>Primorath</strong> \u2013 the first layer of the Abyss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher-tier resources and crafting materials showcased in the trailer will be introduced in <strong>future updates</strong>, as we continue building out the remaining nine layers.<br>So yes, all the good stuff is coming - it\u2019ll just take a little adventuring (and patience)!</p>","developers":["Aloya Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/6915e7b9810560b02409957a06a9095eb676bdf9/header.jpg?t=1757561666","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2747280/1521736150/f8608f1d4ae2da1808f2d51c5dbbf26e385ecf2a/1756453665/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756458178","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2747280/1521736150/f8608f1d4ae2da1808f2d51c5dbbf26e385ecf2a/1756453665/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756458178","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2747280/1521736150/f8608f1d4ae2da1808f2d51c5dbbf26e385ecf2a/1756453665/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756458178","id":257173201,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173201/movie480.mp4?t=1756458178","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173201/movie_max.mp4?t=1756458178"},"name"